# Frontend configuration (Vite). Copy this file to .env.
#
# The only variable the app reads. It is PUBLIC: it is compiled into the browser bundle, so it must be just an
# address. Everything secret (the Django secret key, mail credentials) lives in the API's own environment,
# backend/.env (see backend/.env.example), and never in a VITE_ variable.
#
# In development this defaults to the address `python manage.py runserver` uses, so you can leave it commented out.
# Optional. Default is the same-origin /api/v1 (proxied in dev and preview). Only set this for a non-standard layout.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
